# --- Experiment run-logs must NOT clutter the repo root (enforced) ---
# Findings live in docs/amendments/ + LOGBOOK.md. Redirect raw stdout to archive/run-logs/
# (kept, not ignored) or to a temp path. These root-anchored patterns stop new logs from
# reappearing at the top level while preserving anything filed under archive/run-logs/.
/*_out.txt
/*_err.txt
/*_probe.txt
/*_flux.txt
/*_output.txt
/*.log
/*.tar.gz
# Stray figures at root: real figures belong in docs/figures/
/*.png

# large re-downloadable datasets (removed as ballast 2026-06-06)
data/FashionMNIST/
data/MNIST/
# k2a ingested memories
.k2a/
